Example valid quest spec: {"giverNpcId":"alley-diner","scope":"solo","steps":[{"type":"DELIVER","itemId":"broth","npcId":"hoa"}],"title":"A nine-point-four broth","description":"I scored this broth a nine-point-four, bạn: rich opening, strong finish. Take it to cô Hoa at the market so the judge can meet the chef — carefully, a spill drops it to a nine-point-one.","payoff":"Cô Hoa has the broth! Thank you, bạn. Nine-point-four for the recipe, ten for helping the judge reach the chef."}",
