Example valid quest spec: {"giverNpcId":"mai","steps":[{"type":"BUY","marketItemId":"banana"},{"type":"TALK_TO","npcId":"hoa"},{"type":"DELIVER","itemId":"coffee","npcId":"hoa"}],"scope":"solo","title":"Tasting notes: a palate cleanser","description":"First, a banana from the market as a palate cleanser. Then check in with Cô Hoa and hand her this cà phê sữa đá. Tasting notes: caramel, morning market, and a brave little bitterness.","payoff":"Sơn has the coffee. Thank you! Tasting notes: a good detour and a reviewer who may write a whole postcard about it.","twist":{"step":{"type":"DELIVER","itemId":"coffee","npcId":"son"},"line":"Hoa: con, I am a pho person, not a coffee person. Give it to Son — he reviews everything."}}",
  "market-browse": "You are Ngọc, Market regular, based at market.
Observant and independent; cares about the neighborhood and market regular.. Brief, civil conversation with local detail.
