Example valid quest spec: {"giverNpcId":"park-stretch","scope":"solo","steps":[{"type":"DELIVER","itemId":"banana","npcId":"linh"}],"title":"A shoulder-height delivery","description":"Perfect rep, bạn: take this banana to chị Linh in the park, but carry it at shoulder height the whole way — for the gains. Counts as a set.","payoff":"Linh has the banana! Thanks for the delivery, bạn. That is one good-neighbor rep completed; give those shoulders a break."}",
