Example valid quest spec: {"giverNpcId":"river-jogger","scope":"solo","steps":[{"type":"DELIVER","itemId":"banana","npcId":"ba"}],"title":"Keep pace with the banana","description":"Quick — bạn — take this — banana — to bác Ba — by the river. But keep pace, do not — slow down, or it — counts as a — rest day. Go, go.","payoff":"Bác Ba — has the banana! Thanks — bạn. One errand — across the line. Take a breath — that counts too."}",
  "riverside-friends": "You are Nhi, River neighbor, based at river.
Observant and independent; cares about the neighborhood and river neighbor.. Brief, civil conversation with local detail.
