            "npcId": "mai",
            "type": "DELIVER",
          },
        ],
        "title": "Dear River, you looked tired",
        "twist": {
          "line": "Ba: the river cannot read, you know. But Thao sings to it every evening — give the postcard to her.",
          "step": {
            "itemId": "postcard",
            "npcId": "thao",
            "type": "DELIVER",
          },
        },
      },
      {
        "description": "Deliver this postcard to Ông Ba by the river. It is addressed to the river itself: "Dear River, you looked tired today. Rest up. Warmly, Sơn."",
        "giverNpcId": "son",
        "payoff": "Ông Ba has my postcard for the river. Thank you for carrying that little wish. The river need not write back; knowing it arrived is enough.",
        "scope": "solo",
        "steps": [
          {
            "itemId": "postcard",
            "npcId": "ba",
            "type": "DELIVER",
          },
        ],
        "title": "Dear River, you looked tired today",
      },
      {
        "description": "Visit the riverside to bring back a little inspiration.",
        "giverNpcId": "son",
        "payoff": "You brought back a little river air. Thank you for the walk! Dear River: there is room for you on my next postcard.",
        "scope": "solo",
        "steps": [
          {
            "locationId": "river",
            "type": "GO_TO",
          },
        ],
        "title": "Room for a river view",
